  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FIFA Guardians Safeguarding in Sports Diploma</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The OU will develop and deliver a suite of 5 online courses on safeguarding in sports directed mainly, but not exclusively, to learners from FIFA&#x2019;s 211 Member Associations (MAs) as well as other selected learners from the football community. They will be largely delivered online with the online content openly and freely available to all learners in football and other sports as well as non-sporting organisations. The Courses will also be accompanied by individualised feedback on FIFA Learners&#x2019; outputs and face-to-face FIFA Residential Workshops for FIFA Learners only.</narrative>
  </description>
